            "blazor": "@Tiles(8, 1)",
            "rationale": "The equivalent tiles require article and paragraph semantics plus computed grid letters in both lanes. Article, paragraph, and div are outside the closed vocabulary, and repeat cannot compute the letters."
          }
        ],
